{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 22, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "O fair traveller, set forth on thy journey to the land of rising sun, Japan, and let me guide thy way with a Shakespearean itinerary, free from the bondage of commas.\n\nFirst day, thy sojourn commence in Tokyo, the city of neon lights and ancient traditions. Walk upon the streets of Shibuya, where the throngs of people shall amaze thee. In the evening, dine at a sushi bar, where the delicate flavors of fresh fish shall tantalize thy taste buds.\n\nSecond day, venture into the heart of Tokyo, to the imperial palace, a symbol of Japan's rich history. Walk through the gates, and imagine the days of old, when samurai and shoguns ruled the land. In the afternoon, visit the Senso-ji temple, where the incense fills the air and the teachings of Buddha shall enlighten thy spirit.\n\nThird day, take a train to Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples. Walk upon the Philosopher's Path, where the cherry blossoms shall dance in the breeze, if thou visit in spring. In the evening, attend a traditional tea ceremony, where the art of hospitality shall be revealed to thee.\n\nFourth day, explore the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, where the towering bamboo shall make thee feel as if in a green cathedral. In the afternoon, visit the Kinkaku-ji temple, the Golden Pavilion, where the reflection of the golden building in the pond shall dazzle thee.\n\nFifth day, travel to Nara, the ancient capital of Japan. Feed the deer in Nara Park, where the gentle creatures shall approach thee in search of crackers. In the evening, stay at a traditional ryokan, where the soothing hot springs shall ease thy weary bones.\n\nSixth day, return to Tokyo, and visit the Meiji Shrine, where the Shinto beliefs shall be revealed to thee. In the afternoon, shop at the Harajuku district, where the fashion and culture of the youth shall inspire thee.\n\nSeventh day, thy journey end in Tokyo, where thou can reflect on the experiences and memories gained. Take a moment to look back on the days spent in Japan, and know that the beauty and culture of this land shall forever remain in thy heart.\n\nAnd thus, O fair traveller, thy journey in Japan, guided by this Shakespearean itinerary, shall be a tale to remember, filled with wonder and amazement, free from the constraints of commas.", "logprobs": [{"token": "O", "logprob": -4.708876132965088}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -1.9656730890274048}, {"token": " trav", "logprob": -2.0556652545928955}, {"token": "eller", "logprob": -0.004538948182016611}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.04450269043445587}, {"token": " set", "logprob": -4.208827018737793}, {"token": " forth", "logprob": -0.8401128053665161}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.8518854379653931}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.5943456888198853}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.2740825414657593}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.2988353371620178}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.2388913780450821}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.23100130259990692}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.014962470158934593}, {"token": " rising", "logprob": -0.776488721370697}, {"token": " sun", "logprob": -0.014618197456002235}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.049763526767492294}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.7613495588302612}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.21604885160923004}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.6762367486953735}, {"token": " let", "logprob": -0.6989521384239197}, {"token": " me", "logprob": -0.7504801154136658}, {"token": " guide", "logprob": -0.8799192905426025}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.5265252590179443}, {"token": " way", "logprob": -2.747058153152466}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.38826853036880493}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.17651528120040894}, {"token": " Shakespeare", "logprob": -0.7675355672836304}, {"token": "an", "logprob": -5.030505417380482e-05}, {"token": " itiner", "logprob": -0.6154019832611084}, {"token": "ary", "logprob": -0.000101084369